I think that I agree with you on all of that,

3356
02:05:55.829 --> 02:05:58.604
but I also think that some of what you're talking

3357
02:05:58.604 --> 02:06:01.161
about is a bit esoteric.

3358
02:06:01.161 --> 02:06:03.320
Like in the context of like a young male,

3359
02:06:03.320 --> 02:06:06.884
who's struggling with his relationship to masculinity

3360
02:06:06.884 --> 02:06:10.551
and his peer group, the only way to motivate

3361
02:06:14.105 --> 02:06:16.520
that young individual to engage

3362
02:06:16.520 --> 02:06:20.687
with his interior emotional life in a healthy way.

3363
02:06:23.320 --> 02:06:24.436
If he's one of these people

3364
02:06:24.436 --> 02:06:26.483
that seems shut down in that regard,

3365
02:06:26.483 --> 02:06:28.622
is to model healthy behavior

3366
02:06:28.622 --> 02:06:30.028
in that guy's environment.

3367
02:06:30.028 --> 02:06:34.361
So putting a strong male in proximity to that person

3368
02:06:35.349 --> 02:06:38.969
who is an example of how to kind of do this

3369
02:06:38.969 --> 02:06:42.222
in a healthy way, I think is really the lever

3370
02:06:42.222 --> 02:06:43.472
that moves the needle.

3371
02:06:43.472 --> 02:06:46.248
So whether it's somebody in the community

3372
02:06:46.248 --> 02:06:50.000
or a relative or a coach or a teacher,

3373
02:06:50.000 --> 02:06:52.388
or somebody on YouTube

3374
02:06:52.388 --> 02:06:54.814
or a podcast host or something like that,

3375
02:06:54.814 --> 02:06:57.665
that that young person can connect with

3376
02:06:57.665 --> 02:07:01.748
and start to think a little bit differently about

3377
02:07:02.949 --> 02:07:04.953
how he's relating to himself

3378
02:07:04.953 --> 02:07:06.444
and his direct environment

3379
02:07:06.444 --> 02:07:08.671
I think is a really powerful thing.

3380
02:07:08.671 --> 02:07:10.470
That would be the advice that I would give.

3381
02:07:10.470 --> 02:07:12.844
Having mentors is key.

3382
02:07:12.844 --> 02:07:14.660
And also holding yourself accountable

3383
02:07:14.660 --> 02:07:16.346
