3384
02:07:16.346 --> 02:07:18.760
If you say you're gonna do something, go do it.

3385
02:07:18.760 --> 02:07:20.900
Like these kinds of things can make you feel.

3386
02:07:20.900 --> 02:07:23.275
And it's probably just about growing up in general

3387
02:07:23.275 --> 02:07:24.441
but as a young man,

3388
02:07:24.441 --> 02:07:25.726
it can make you feel more of a man.

3389
02:07:25.726 --> 02:07:26.713
If you know you can rely

3390
02:07:26.713 --> 02:07:29.223
