3403
02:07:49.211 --> 02:07:51.185
Well, I mean, it depends on the individual

3404
02:07:51.185 --> 02:07:54.365
but that's why I think just having healthy males

3405
02:07:54.365 --> 02:07:55.937
that model healthy behavior

3406
